# The runtime stage fetches ALL source via install.sh (from the GitHub
# tarball), so the build context only needs frontend/ source for the Vite
# builder stage. Exclude everything else, plus the heavy/stale frontend
# artifacts, to keep the context small and the builder reproducible.
*
!frontend
frontend/node_modules
frontend/**/node_modules
frontend/**/dist
frontend/.turbo
**/.DS_Store
